# Force the Netlify subdomain to 301-redirect to the canonical custom domain.
# Without this, Google may keep indexing sladent.netlify.app alongside sladent.com.
https://sladent.netlify.app/*    https://sladent.com/:splat    301!
http://sladent.netlify.app/*     https://sladent.com/:splat    301!
# The page generator lives in the repo but is not part of the site.
/build.py    /404.html    404!
